# Riverfork Delta (CIPlay riverfork_delta): the mouth at 0 -52, the outpost at -2 -16, the vines -11 1, the ferry
# crank -16 8.5, upriver round 0 45 with the fuel cache -8 48 and the pressing shed 6 42.
island Riverfork Delta
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Rivers
zone mouth
expect step 1
read River chart
expect step 2
open Outpost tool rack
wait 3
expect item Machete 1
expect step 3
use westvines
expect hidden westvines
zone west_arm
expect step 4
use ferrycrank
expect story ferry 1
expect step 5
zone upriver
expect step 6
kill Warthog
expect animals Warthog 0
expect step 7
open Fuel cache
wait 3
expect step 9
open Pressing shed
wait 3
expect step 10
read Ranger log 4
expect done
